    "body": "**There is no way to delete a user account.**\r\n\r\nI want to delete my account because of the ridiculous account inactivity fee and because there is no granularity on choosing what emails you receive. This note is beside the point and addressing my reasons to leave do not excuse the main topic of this bug report.\r\n\r\nOn the website there is no button which can be clicked to close an account. My understanding is that the current behavior violates some laws in certain US states and possibly certain European laws. I will not go find those specific legal references, it is not my responsibility to do Bountysource's legal work for them.",
